        "text": "Cryptocurrencies are easier to audit than in game currencies, and it is easy to transfer and convert digital currency via the blockchain, whereas centrally administered in game currencies and assets are not transferable among different gaming ecosystems. Moreover, just as we can establish who owns something, we can also show that an item is original and unique using blockchain technology. This ability is critical in the Metaverse, because digital objects can be easily copied. Governance tokens and DAOs provide the tools for decentralized decision making, allowing users to control the rules of their interaction with the Metaverse.",
